<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA+ rating to Chubu Electric's bond.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA+ rating to Chubu Electric's bond.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Monday that it has assigned its AA+ rating to Chubu Electric Power Co Inc's 50 billion yen 3.125 percent straight bond series due on April 25, 2017.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said in a statement that the rating reflected the company's strong business position as the sole provider of electricity in Japan's central Chubu region.</p>
<p>It said the outlook for the rating was stable.</p>
</text>
